OL,3,GNEWSASimilar solar farm plans to boost
OL,4,Acouncils' coffers
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo neighbouring councils are aiming to
OL,7,Fgenerate green energy and money to fund
OL,8,Flocal services by building and running
OL,9,Ftheir own large solar farms.
OL,11,FWork begins next week to install 43,000
OL,12,Fsolar panels on fields that Wokingham
OL,13,FBorough Council owns in the village of
OL,14,FBarkham.
OL,16,FWest Berkshire Council said
OL,17,Fconstruction would begin at its site
OL,18,Fnear Grazeley in March, with plans for
OL,19,F35,000 panels.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
