OL,3,GNEWSASimilar solar farm plans to boost
OL,4,Acouncils' coffers
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe schemes are not connected but are
OL,7,Fjust a few miles apart, and are
OL,8,Fexpected to be operational by the end
OL,9,Fof 2027.
